  "description_short": "Live music venue with wood-fired pizzas, burgers, and desserts in a relaxed Knysna setting.",
  "description_long": "34 Waenhout brings together live music, comfort food, and a laid-back atmosphere on Waenhout Avenue in Knysna. The venue serves wood-fired pizzas, American-style burgers, and a tempting selection of ice cream and desserts, making it a popular spot for casual evenings out with friends or family.\n\nThe live music draws a local crowd, while the menu keeps things simple and satisfying. Whether you're stopping by for a pizza and a drink during a show, or bringing the kids for burgers and ice cream, the vibe is easy-going and welcoming. It's the kind of place where you can settle in for the evening or pop in for a quick bite.\n\nLocated away from the waterfront bustle, 34 Waenhout offers Knysna locals and visitors a relaxed alternative with good food, regular entertainment, and a friendly neighbourhood feel.",
